Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.76,0:22:06.72,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)}努力地抗拒着
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.72,0:22:08.22,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)}可无论如何  不管怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.22,0:22:10.14,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)}最终还是会败下阵来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.14,0:22:13.65,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\t(1000,2200,\cC22331)}如果现在能重新来过
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.65,0:22:17.15,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\cC22331}愿望如梦般短暂 {\fn\fscx\fscy}Rollin’
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.15,0:22:19.28,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\cC22331}但人生很长
